---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Who is TravelHackz? A travel blog and podcast built on practical, no-fluff guides."
>
  <section class="container page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Practical travel advice, not generic top-10 lists.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      TravelHackz goes beyond "best 10 places" lists. Every post answers a specific question:{' '}
      <em>what time should I go, how much will it cost, and in what order should I do it?</em>
    </p>
    <p>
      Our first series, <a href="/istanbul-unpacked">Istanbul Unpacked</a>, is the written
      companion to our podcast of the same name — an 8-episode guide that walks through
      Istanbul from arrival to your last day, with real timing and real prices. From there
      we've branched out to the rest of the country: Cappadocia, Pamukkale, Antalya, Ephesus,
      Bodrum and the Turquoise Coast, with more destinations on the way.
    </p>
    <p>
      Questions, suggestions, or partnership ideas? Reach us at
      <a href={`mailto:info.travelhackz@gmail.com`}>info.travelhackz@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 4rem 0 5rem;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
